            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "List ki cheezein index ko nayi qeemat de kar badli ja sakti hain, aur append() se nayi cheezein jori ja sakti hain."
          },
          {
            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "note",
            "title": "Python code (har .... ek 4-space indent hai)",
            "text": "fruits = [\"Mango\", \"Apple\", \"Banana\"]\nfruits[0] = \"Orange\"\nfruits.append(\"Pineapple\")\nprint(fruits)    # ['Orange', 'Apple', 'Banana', 'Pineapple']"
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "self_check",
            "prompt": "In lines ke baad fruits mein kitni cheezein hain aur fruits[-1] kya hai?",
            "explanation": "Chaar cheezein; fruits[-1] 'Pineapple' hai."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Fauri khulasa"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "fruits[i] = value se cheez badlein; append() se aakhir mein jorein."
